      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ Error Handler (shared)\nUsed by **UK Legal Intake** and **UK Client Care Letter**.\n\nIf any node fails (after its automatic retries):\n1. The team gets an email with the workflow, the failed node, the error and a link to the execution\n2. The error is logged in Google Sheets (Error Log tab) as **Open** until someone reviews it\n\nSet it in each workflow: Settings → Error Workflow.",
